----- CHANGELOG ------

Mouse handling reworked, now modifies the raw position, should be generally more compatible with mods
Added a world blur config for 26.x versions
Added FOV override config, helps improve visibility on high FOVs
Added 'Auto Detect Camera Mode', changes the camera mode depending on your perspective (default off)
Reworked the screens config to use an inclusion/exclusion list, providing more customizability, especially w/ mods
Fixed REI tooltips and late-rendered widgets rendering flat on the screen instead of on the spatial GUI (fabric)
Fixed a black flash when opening screens such as REI recipe views on 26.x
Fixed a VulkanMod compatibility issue where the screen rendered flipped
Dynamic Crosshair compatibility, the crosshair is always shown in first person in the spatial GUI
Tons of GUI scaling & mouse related bug fixes
Huge thanks to vibing/nullsoepic on GitHub!